[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; SplineIK3D under the Skeleton3D it modifies, which is the only placement where
; a SkeletonModifier3D does anything. The subject is the four leaves it adds to
; ChainIK3D's settings/<i>/ family: tilt_fade_in and tilt_fade_out are bone
; COUNTS with a "-1,100,1,or_greater" hint, not angles, so nothing here is
; stored in radians. Setting 1 turns tilt off, the state in which Godot stops
; serialising the two fade keys at all.

